	{
		{"mwf"},
		{"msgoff"},
		{"bg", del=2, lv=0, id=31, path=":bg/", file="black", time=1000, wait=500, sync=1},
		{"bgm", stop=1, [1]="", time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=1, time=1500},
		{"excall", call=0, file="hat010040b"},
		line=1095,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			{
"Today is the day Empress Hisui is attending our academy.",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"When I step outside, I run into Akari.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			{
"I haven't talked with her since what happened yesterday.",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Morning.”",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Morning.”",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			{
"Akari's eyes are a little red around the edges.",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			{
"I avert my gaze to avoid looking directly at her.",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“How are you feeling?”",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'm all good. What about you?”",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Same here.”",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			{
"She looks away, awkwardly twirling her hair.",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Thank you for giving me your honest opinion yesterday.”",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'm still coming to terms with it, but I'm at least grateful you gave it to me.”",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It's how I truly feel.”",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'd appreciate it if you'd give it more thought.”",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I will.”",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			{
"She says with a stiff expression.",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			{
"I suppose it's too much to ask for after just one day.",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Good morning. You two sure are lively this morning.”",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			{
"We're greeted by someone who looks much closer to death.",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Good morning. I'm sorry for all the trouble we caused you yesterday.”",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“No, no, pay it no mind.”",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“It's just... the Army is on edge because of the upcoming Armistice Day ceremony. So making a ruckus like that...”",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			{
"Gunshots ring out from the distance.",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“See? First thing in the morning. They must sure love their jobs...”",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			{
"The manager says with a dejected shrug.",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“We'll definitely be careful.”",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Yes, have a good day at school.”",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“We'll see you later.”",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			{
"Akari gives him a short bow.",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Akari-san.”",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			{
"The manager calls out to Akari alone.",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			{
"Sensing his intention, I head on without her.",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“What is it?”",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Here. A little gift for you.”",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Hard candies? What for?”",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“It'll help perk up your eyes.”",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Ah...”",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Now then, good day to you.”",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			{
"The Persica Blossom Festival is this weekend, and the whole city is in the process of being decked with resplendent decorations.",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			{
"Put simply, the Persica Blossom Festival is a flower-viewing holiday spanning all of Tenkyo.",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			{
"During the festival, nearly everyone takes time off except workers in the service industry.",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			{
"The revelers stake out their favorite locations, admire the peach flowers in full bloom, and enjoy wonderful food and drink and company.",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			{
"Taking place at the end of every March, it's an event for all of Tenkyo's residents to truly appreciate the coming of spring.",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“The Persica Blossom Festival, huh?”",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			{
"Akari lets out a heavy sigh.",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Bad memories?”",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“On the night of the festival, there was this dance I always had to perform in front of my parents.”",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“It's called the Dance of Persica, and it's been passed down through the Imperial Family for generations.”",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Gosh, it was so embarrassing that I tried to run away every year.”",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I, for one, would love to see it.”",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“No way, no way! It's nothing worth seeing.”",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“My mother was so good at it that it would steal your breath away, though.”",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			{
"Akari falls silent for a moment, narrowing her eyes.",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“This year, it looks like I'll get to check out the festival in the city, so I'm really looking forward to it.”",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah, me too.”",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			{
"Even in times like these, the prospect of the Persica Blossom Festival can't help but set the heart aflutter.",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			{
"But the Armistice Day ceremony will be coming in on Sunday to spoil the good spirits.",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			{
"After the war, Okonogi designated March 20th as Armistice Day to commemorate the cessation of hostilities.",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			{
"It was the day he signed a peace treaty with the Republic as plenipotentiary of the Empire.",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			{
"Every year on this day, the government holds a grand memorial ceremony.",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			{
"For Republicans, it's a day to celebrate their glorious victory in the war, but for Imperials, it's a day of disgrace.",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If only it was just the festival this weekend.”",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Talking about the Armistice Day ceremony?”",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“What was the ceremony like last year?”",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Before the ceremony even started, there was a big military parade. They closed off all the main roads and had the Army march down them.”",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“And they hired a bunch of Imperials to wave flags and welcome them.”",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“During the actual ceremony, the governor-general and Empress Hisui stand side-by-side and pledge everlasting peace.”",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“When night falls, drunken Republican soldiers flood into the streets and wreak havoc.”",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Who knows how many civilians fell victim to them last year...”",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“What the heck?”",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			{
"Unlike previous years, though, this year we intend to get one over on the Republican Army.",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			{
"At the Sworn Blades meeting the other day, we made plans to raid a military storehouse on the day of the ceremony.",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			{
"According to Koyuzu's intel, quite a few spellblades are stored there.",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“So basically, the whole ceremony is just for the Republic to make clear to the Empire who's on top; a political show of force.”",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Pretty much. Before the war, it would be unthinkable for Her Majesty to stand alongside anyone else as an equal.”",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“That goes without saying.”",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“On top of that, promising peace with the Republic? That's so ridiculous I don't know where to even start.”",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“That very Empress Hisui is coming to school today. If you must, get it out of your system here and now.”",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If you confront her and make a scene, it'll be the Imperials who get angry.”",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Ugh... This is gonna be one looong day...”",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Think of it as a test of your patience.”",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			{
"I try to help raise Akari's spirits as we walk down the road to school.",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			{
"A crowd of people is gathered in front of the school gates.",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“They're searching our personal belongings, huh? Security sure is strict today.”",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“She could've spared us all this trouble by not coming in the first place.”",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You're not carrying any weapons, are you?”",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Of course not.”",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			{
"I ask her just to be sure before we submit to the inspection.",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			{
"Next to me, Akari's face is the very picture of sourness.",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			{
"This inspection doesn't serve any purpose besides to humiliate us.",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“Good morning, Soujin. Miyaguni-san.”",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			{
"Rochel waves at us from a bench in the courtyard.",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“You've always been coming to school together lately. Glad to see it.”",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Trying to make a thing out of the two of us again? You sure enjoy doing that.”",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“Hahaha, I don't mean anything bad by it.”",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“Believe it or not, I'm actually rather fond of romance novels.”",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“And from my point of view, you two are a perfect match for each other.”",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hahaha, you really need to get your eyes checked.”",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Yeah, no kidding.”",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			{
"Akari takes a step away from me, putting on a strained smile.",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“Hmm, if only there was a way I could help you.”",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			{
"He crosses his arms and ponders earnestly.",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“Oh, I've got an idea.”",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“In Western fairy tales, there's usually an evil witch who abducts the beautiful princess, and...”",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah, yeah. I've heard enough.”",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			{
"From the looks of things, he's about to start going on and on.",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Instead of being concerned over us, you should focus on yourself.”",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“Really? I thought it was a good plan.”",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We'll pass.”",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“Too bad.”",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			{
"We say goodbye to Rochel and make for the school building.",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“What sorta romance novels is that guy even reading?”",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Beats me.”",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			{
"After first period, we suddenly hear an announcement on the school's intercom.",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“This is a message from the student council. All students, a moment of your attention please.”",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			{
"The student council president's voice flows from the speakers.",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“As you are all surely aware, Her Majesty Empress Hisui will be attending our school today.”",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“At present, she is scheduled to arrive in approximately twenty minutes.”",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			{
"Twenty minutes from now would be in the middle of second period.",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Classes will still be in session at that time, and Her Majesty has expressed her wishes to not cause any disturbances.”",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Hence, please kindly refrain from any untoward behavior such as heading to the school gates, and carry on with your studies as usual.”",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I believe our school to be a place full of sensible students who display excellent judgment.”",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“As such, please do strive to act calmly. That is all.”",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We will soon be in the presence of Empress Hisui. We must display our prudence.”",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			{
"Hotori gives a single, solemn nod.",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Yeah, not happening.”",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Seconded. We need to get going now, or all the good spots will be taken.”",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			{
"Akari and Shino immediately begin planning their route.",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hey, now! You two...”",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Heheheh. Panic all you want, but it's already too late.”",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Cower in fear at the extent of my mighty preparations!       Ta-da!”",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			{
"Kotone withdraws a scrap of paper from her bag.",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“What's this? 'Rooftop Viewing Ticket (Front Row), 1500\nYen?'”",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“With this bad boy, one may admire Empress Hisui from the rooftop at one's leisure!”",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Hup!”",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			{
"Hotori's arm flashes through the air.",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“H-Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			{
"The Rooftop Viewing Ticket (Front Row) is reduced to tiny scraps drifting on the breeze.",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“W-Waaaaaaahhh!”",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“To look down on Her Majesty...”",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			{
"Hotori deftly returns the hairpin she'd used as a makeshift blade.",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Oooh! My precious fifteen hundred yen...”",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“There, there, don't cry now. That was a counterfeit ticket I made myself.”",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Oh, is that so? What a relief.”",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“...Huh? Is it just me, or was that a rather outrageous admission?”",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			{
"Shino hands Kotone her money back, laughing uncontrollably all the while.",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“As I was saying, we must act with prudence.”",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You're no fun.”",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“A warrior is but a blade. All else is extraneous.”",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Whatever you say, you goody two-shoes.”",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			{
"Brushing me off, Akari stands and starts walking off.",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			{
"The second period begins.",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			{
"As the scheduled time approaches, the classroom is filled with an atmosphere of anticipation like that of counting down to midnight on New Year's Eve.",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			{
"─She's here!",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			{
"In the blink of an eye, all our classmates glue themselves to the windows facing the school gate.",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			{
"The only ones that remain seated are me, Hotori, and the president along with some of her entourage.",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			{
"We all share a glance with each other and collectively sigh.",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Knew it'd turn out like this...”",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I think that earlier announcement backfired.”",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Maybe she actually wanted to make a ruckus.”",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“And if that's the case, we can't afford to just sit idly by...”",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Right?”",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			{
"I stand up and move behind my classmates crowded at the window.",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			{
"I look at the courtyard and notice a convoy of cars that've just come to a stop.",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			{
"A cautious-looking guard first steps outside.",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			{
"He proceeds to the backseat door and opens it, remaining vigilant of his surroundings.",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“She has arrived. She has finally arrived!”",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			{
"A pair of beautiful legs is the first we see of her.",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			{
"Then, as though unfurling her long-restricted wings, a uniform-clad Empress Hisui basks in the radiance of the early spring sun.",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			{
"Not a single person dares to speak.",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			{
"All that can be heard are faint sighs of admiration.",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			{
"It seems true beauty is capable of silencing anyone, no matter their nationality.",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“(She's lovely.)”",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			{
"Empress Hisui slowly surveys the students watching her from above.",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“How embarrassing, to be tardy on my very first day of school.”",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			{
"A swell of excited cheers erupts throughout the classroom.",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Waaaaaaaaah! Aaaaaaaaaahhhhh!”",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Kill me! Just kill me now!”",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			{
"The Exalt-Priestess howls with elation.",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“An entrance like that oughta be illegal... Who wouldn't fall for that?”",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“As much as I hate to admit it, you're totally right...”",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“The Empress suuure is cut from a different cloth.”",
			},
		},
		[184]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Right?”",
			},
		},
		[185]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“There's nothing 'right' about that!”",
			},
		},
		[186]={
			{
"She digs her fist into my abdomen, but it doesn't hurt at all.",
			},
		},
		[187]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Ghh... So hard...”",
			},
		},
		[188]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Don't worry. I'm just joking.”",
			},
		},
		[189]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I don't wanna hear it, you traitor!”",
			},
		},
		[190]={
			{
"She pulls back her fist, glaring at me all the while.",
			},
		},
		[191]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ahh, look! Her Majesty is waving at us!”",
			},
		},
		[192]={
			{
"Empress Hisui is waving her hand in response to all the students watching her from the windows.",
			},
		},
		[193]={
			{
"Not anyone individually, to be sure, but it is already most gracious of her to acknowledge our presence.",
			},
		},
		[194]={
			{
"As for me, however, I can't help but see her as just a pitiful puppet.",
			},
		},
		[195]={
			{
"But it is still a fact that her smile has healed the hearts of countless Imperial citizens.",
			},
		},
		[196]={
			{
"I have nothing but the most sincere gratitude for this nameless girl playing the role of Empress.",
			},
		},
		[197]={
			{
"Of course, that doesn't mean everyone respects Empress Hisui in the same way.",
			},
		},
		[198]={
			{
"Among the Republicans gathered by the window, some are whistling or pointing while jeering at her.",
			},
		},
		[199]={
			{
"To them, she's nothing more than a spectacle.",
			},
		},
		[200]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“(Be right back. Got some murdering to do...)”",
			},
		},
		[201]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“(Get back here!)”",
			},
		},
		[202]={
			{
"I grab Hotori by the scruff of the neck right as she's about to jump them.",
			},
		},
		[203]={
			{
"Here she was the one saying we should act with prudence, but seeing Empress Hisui insulted already has her like this.",
			},
		},
		[204]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Thank you for the warm welcome.”",
			},
		},
		[205]={
			{
"Empress Hisui surely saw the Republicans' malicious gazes, yet she doesn't break her smile.",
			},
		},
		[206]={
			{
"She continues politely waving her hand.",
			},
		},
		[207]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Good day to you all. It's my pleasure to make your acquaintance.”",
			},
		},
		[208]={
			{
"Empress Hisui waves in our direction.",
			},
		},
		[209]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Good day─!”",
			},
		},
		[210]={
			{
"Empress Hisui stares directly at me.",
			},
		},
		[211]={
			{
"Her round eyes are opened as far as they can be.",
			},
		},
		[212]={
			{
"She's definitely looking right at me.",
			},
		},
		[213]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“(Onii-sama!?)”",
			},
		},
		[214]={
			{
"Her lips move, but she's too far away for me to read what they are saying.",
			},
		},
		[215]={
			{
"What on earth did she say?",
			},
		},
		[216]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[217]={
			{
"Empress Hisui freezes up, and the crowd begins to murmur.",
			},
		},
		[218]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“*Cough, cough cough!*”",
			},
		},
		[219]={
			{
"Empress Hisui lets out a sudden cough.",
			},
		},
		[220]={
			{
"But she quickly floats a benevolent smile and starts waving in another direction.",
			},
		},
		[221]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“(Does Her Majesty know me?)”",
			},
		},
		[222]={
			{
"I don't have any recollection of meeting Empress Hisui.",
			},
		},
		[223]={
			{
"Could we have met somewhere before the war?",
			},
		},
		[224]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“She made eye contact with me...”",
			},
		},
		[225]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Nah girl, she was just using a little technique that makes it look like you're making eye contact with everyone.”",
			},
		},
		[226]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Noooo waaay! She totally looked right at me!”",
			},
		},
		[227]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“What's wrong, Soujin? You're stiff as a statue.”",
			},
		},
		[228]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We made eye contact.”",
			},
		},
		[229]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“See, listen, there's this trick that lets you...”",
			},
		},
		[230]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'm absolutely positive.”",
			},
		},
		[231]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Well, good for you, then!”",
			},
		},
		[232]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You big, stupid jerk!”",
			},
		},
		[233]={
			{
"Akari stalks back to her seat.",
			},
		},
		[234]={
			{
"In the courtyard, Empress Hisui finally finishes with her salutations and heads for the visitors' entrance.",
			},
		},
		[235]={
			{
"A fake Empress created by Okonogi, huh?",
			},
		},
		[236]={
			{
"Just who might she be?",
			},
		},
	},
	label={
	},
}
